 of a real workshop.","ar":"هذا الجزء الثالث، سلامة الورشة. ستسمع قواعد ورشة حقيقيّة."},"id":"L002"},{"actor":"sami","start":13.798,"text":{"en":"What safety rules do you know for a workshop?","ar":"ما قواعد السلامة التي تعرفها للورشة؟"},"id":"L003"},{"actor":"sami","start":17.532,"text":{"en":"In our workshop, we follow safety rules.","ar":"في ورشتنا، نتّبع قواعد السلامة."},"id":"L004"},{"actor":"sami","start":21.362,"text":{"en":"First, we wear goggles near the machines.","ar":"أوّلاً، نرتدي نظّارات واقية قرب الآلات."},"id":"L005"},{"actor":"sami","start":25.144,"text":{"en":"We keep the floor clean and tidy.","ar":"نُبقي الأرض نظيفة ومرتّبة."},"id":"L006"},{"actor":"sami","start":28.302,"text":{"en":"We never touch a moving blade.","ar":"لا نلمس نصلاً متحرّكاً أبداً."},"id":"L007"},{"actor":"sami","start":31.364,"text":{"en":"And we never use a broken tool.","ar":"ولا نستخدم أداة معطّلة أبداً."},"id":"L008"},{"actor":"sami","start":34.546,"text":{"en":"If a machine is loud, we wear ear protection.","ar":"إن كانت الآلة صاخبة، نرتدي واقي الأذنين."},"id":"L009"},{"actor":"sami","start":38.424,"text":{"en":"Before you use a big machine, always ask Ustaz Sami.","ar":"قبل أن تستخدم آلة كبيرة، اسأل الأستاذ سامي دائماً."},"id":"L010"},{"actor":"sami","start":43.094,"text":{"en":"Safety keeps everyone well.","ar":"السلامة تُبقي الجميع بخير."},"id":"L011"},{"actor":"khaled","start":46.036,"text":{"en":"The first question is done. Yes, we follow the rules.","ar":"السؤال الأوّل محلول. نعم، نحن نتّبع القواعد."},"id":"L012"},{"actor":"khaled","start":51.042,"text":{"en":"What do workers wear near the machines?","ar":"ماذا يرتدي العمّال قرب الآلات؟"},"subHold":8.222,"id":"L013"},{"actor":"khaled","start":59.264,"text":{"en":"Goggles.","ar":"نظّارات واقية."},"id":"L014"},{"actor":"khaled","start":61.486,"text":{"en":"What must you never touch?","ar":"ما الذي يجب ألّا تلمسه أبداً؟"},"subHold":6.834,"id":"L015"},{"actor":"khaled","start":68.32,"text":{"en":"A moving blade.","ar":"نصلاً متحرّكاً."},"id":"L016"},{"actor":"khaled","start":70.542,"text":{"en":"Who do you ask before using a big machine?","ar":"مَن تسأل قبل استخدام آلة كبيرة؟"},"subHold":8.566,"id":"L017"},{"actor":"khaled","start":79.108,"text":{"en":"Ustaz Sami.","ar":"الأستاذ سامي."},"id":"L018"},{"actor":"sami","start":81.402,"text":{"en":"Notice the word moving in that answer.","ar":"لاحظ كلمة «متحرّك» في تلك الإجابة."},"id":"L019"},{"actor":"sami","start":84.824,"text":{"en":"A still blade is sharp. A moving blade will not stop for you.","ar":"النصل الساكن حادّ. والنصل المتحرّك لن يتوقّف من أجلك."},"id":"L020"},{"actor":"sami","start":90.478,"text":{"en":"Three phrases carry this talk.","ar":"ثلاث عبارات تحمل هذا الحديث."},"id":"L021"},{"actor":"sami","start":93.564,"text":{"en":"We never. Always ask. Before you use.","ar":"نحن لا نفعل أبداً. اسأل دائماً. قبل أن تستخدم."},"id":"L022"}],"subtitles":{"enabled":true,"langs":"en,ar","show":null,"textMode":"wrapShrink","lang":{}},"badgePlacement":{"x":"0.016","y":"0.016","width":"0.205"},"audio":{"master":"audio.m4a","lines":[{"key":"7b4273a3ab1f1334","bytes":39024,"sha":"be6d55a057c7a091","address":"lines/7b4273a3ab1f1334.mp3"},{"key":"fb89ad640fd08c6f","bytes":36864,"sha":"c6ba8f48b4277856","address":"lines/fb89ad640fd08c6f.mp3"},{"key":"7fec51105d8b7591","bytes":20304,"sha":"9468333d146fa112","address":"lines/7fec51105d8b7591.mp3"},{"key":"d68c46394618539b","bytes":20880,"sha":"ee33a004f05fd914","address":"lines/d68c46394618539b.mp3"},{"key":"8cdba9b4a33cf838","bytes":20592,"sha":"dc689592ebc552f0","address":"lines/8cdba9b4a33cf838.mp3"},{"key":"842b18228157633e","bytes":16848,"sha":"5530ae4bfb64717b","address":"lines/842b18228157633e.mp3"},{"key":"d38ed2e4f1d3349e","bytes":16272,"sha":"72aea02a175378a1","address":"lines/d38ed2e4f1d3349e.mp3"},{"key":"83d1476f5e782332","bytes":16992,"sha":"4386d0fbc6e28a6d","address":"lines/83d1476f5e782332.mp3"},{"key":"57a68d3fa433328e","bytes":21168,"sha":"185d003ce0ae9ba5","address":"lines